{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48986","headline":"主人司空见和未开牡丹輙却奉和 · 孙鲂","name":"主人司空见和未开牡丹輙却奉和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"把笔临芳不自怡，首徵章句促妖期。\n已惊常调言多鄙，遽捧高吟媿可知。\n绝代贞名应愈重，千金方笑更难移。\n狂歌狂醉犹堪羡，大拙当时是老时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙鲂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}